      "content": "idk i dont really have a doctor i can see right now since im between jobs and everything is expensive. i just wanted to know if that dose is safe. i read online that higher doses work faster for the cramps. like if i did 1000mg for a week to catch up, would that be a problem or just make me sleepy?",
