      "content": "i get what u mean about the side effects but i dont really have any stomach issues or anything. i did have my kidneys checked a couple years ago and the doctor said they were fine, so i dont think i have to worry about that. if my kidneys are okay, would 1000mg just be fine to help with the sleep and the cramps? i feel like if i don't get it under control soon i'm gonna be too tired to even look for work.",
